BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mind in Harmony
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260505T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260505T213000
UID:009790746a5b166c801722bb@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Long before modern psychology\, the Buddhist tradition develop
 ed a training manual to help us understand and transform our own minds. Th
 is six-week course brings that manual to life\, illuminating the processes
  through which we experience the world.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mind-in-harmony-may-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Introduction to Buddhism & Meditation Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260518T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260518T214500
UID:23a79d69a247a0569095621f@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This six-week course on Monday evenings will introduce you to 
 key Buddhist principles and two meditation practices that cultivate self-a
 wareness\, open-heartedness\, and insight.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/introduction-to-buddhism
 -meditation-course-may-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mindfulness for Stress
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260604T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260604T213000
UID:c4b1f07b36e7a50ba907a509@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This eight-week evidence-based course is designed to help you 
 manage stress and overwhelm in your life. This course teaches practical mi
 ndfulness tools to reduce stress\, calm anxiety\, and bring balance to dai
 ly life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindfulness-for-stress-j
 un-26
END:VEVENT
